{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54367","headline":"游南雁荡 · 朱着","name":"游南雁荡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山呈图画水鸣弦，石室丹台别有天。\n官况屡来忘是客，凡襟洗去欲成仙。\n只因紫绶覊尘海，须把黄花种玉田。\n药径云关堪驻迹，钓矶风月不须钱。\n（见周喟《南雁荡山志》卷七引陈玭《嘉靖南雁山志》、郑思恭《崇祯南雁山志》。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱着","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54367.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54367","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}